				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 04 Feb 2018 02:31:04 +0000</pubDate>
								<wikidot:authorUserId>3122708</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I said this in chat, but I'll say it again: 'necrokinesis' is a wonderful word.</p> <p>I also quite enjoy how this blends history with magic but in a way that's very ordinary; its tone succeeds at treating magical going-ons as a matter of mere historical record &#8212; interesting history, but just history nevertheless.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
